{"id": "EUVD-2026-92111", "enisaUuid": "6a467b91-5942-3975-be20-6333dece8533", "description": "YesWiki before 4.6.7 contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability in the Bazar valeur action that allows page editors to inject script by rendering unescaped HTML fetched from a remote URL. Attackers can point tools/bazar/actions/valeur.php at a controlled server returning BAZ_fiche_titre markup with an img onerror handler, executing script in every viewer's browser.", "datePublished": "2026-10-04T15:04:53", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T15:36:29", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/security/advisories/GHSA-6rvf-7pwm-6j44", "https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/commit/22a5260b0381824e01d340ce9457c4adb9e18b23", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yeswiki-before-4.6.7-stored-xss-via-bazar-valeur-action"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4jc3-v5mf-cppg", "CVE-2026-105224"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "bffa50c9-b569-3acc-8bec-4c9e308a5a94", "product": {"name": "yeswiki", "vendor": {"name": "YesWiki"}}, "product_version": "0 <4.6.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fff40bdb-f18d-3efa-b655-29ba10c3f9bd", "vendor": {"name": "YesWiki"}}], "isExploited": false}